            "review_title": "Review at Baskin Robbins Da Nang",
            "review_text": "midwaytoheaven\nMidway, Utah2984 contributions\n0\nExpensive \"USA\" Pricing But the Same Great Ice Cream\nOct 2018 • Couples\nNext to Starbucks is this Baskin-Robbins along the river walk. We dropped in on a pretty hot day and got a couple of milkshakes we love. Tasted great like the ones back in the USA. Restaurant is upscale with more seating than normal. They only take Vietnamese Dong currency or credit cards, no USA cash surprisingly.\n\nBOTTOM LINE: Excellent ice cream and service. It was more expensive that I expected. They no not speak English here so just point to what you want and have either dong or credit card for payment. Very impressed with how nice this store looked. MY RATING: 9/10\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten February 10, 2019",
            "rating": 5.0,
